{"id":"c1a5f3d8-6b42-4e19-8f73-0d5c2a9e4b17","revision":0,"last_node_id":12,"last_link_id":16,"nodes":[{"id":12,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[40,166],"size":[620,600],"flags":{},"order":0,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"使用说明","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"MarkdownNote","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["## 背景音乐 (ACE-Step v1.5)\n\n**引擎**: ACE-Step v1.5 Turbo (StepFun / ACE Studio)\n**权重**: `checkpoints/ComfyUI-ACE-Step/ace_step_1.5_turbo_aio.safetensors`（9.34G，本地现成）\n\n### md 表字段 → 节点接线\n- **音乐提示词** → `TextEncodeAceStepAudio1.5` 的 `tags`（风格/氛围描述）\n- **秒数** → 同节点的 `duration` + `EmptyAceStep1.5LatentAudio` 的 `seconds`\n- **ID** → `SaveAudioAdvanced` 的 `filename_prefix`\n\n### 链路\nMD 数据表 → ACE-Step 编码（tags/duration）→ KSampler → VAE 解码 → 预览 → 继续闸门 → 保存\n\n### 参数要点\n- **纯音乐**：`lyrics` 留空即无人声；若要带唱，把歌词写进该字段\n- **步数 8 / cfg 1**：turbo 权重官方配方，不要按常规 20 步调\n- **shift 3**（`ModelSamplingAuraFlow`）：ACE-Step 官方模板值，改大更发散、改小更贴提示词\n- **bpm / 调式**：`120` / `C minor` 为氛围乐默认，可按需改\n- **去 LLM 改写**：本工作流直连 md 表提示词，不做二次改写\n\n### 与 0062 的区别\n- 0060 走 ACE-Step（音乐结构、和声、节奏都在行）\n- 0062 走 Stable Audio 3 small_sfx（只擅长音效，不擅长成曲）"],"widgets_values_named":{"text":"## 背景音乐 (ACE-Step v1.5)\n\n**引擎**: ACE-Step v1.5 Turbo (StepFun / ACE Studio)\n**权重**: `checkpoints/ComfyUI-ACE-Step/ace_step_1.5_turbo_aio.safetensors`（9.34G，本地现成）\n\n### md 表字段 → 节点接线\n- **音乐提示词** → `TextEncodeAceStepAudio1.5` 的 `tags`（风格/氛围描述）\n- **秒数** → 同节点的 `duration` + `EmptyAceStep1.5LatentAudio` 的 `seconds`\n- **ID** → `SaveAudioAdvanced` 的 `filename_prefix`\n\n### 链路\nMD 数据表 → ACE-Step 编码（tags/duration）→ KSampler → VAE 解码 → 预览 → 继续闸门 → 保存\n\n### 参数要点\n- **纯音乐**：`lyrics` 留空即无人声；若要带唱，把歌词写进该字段\n- **步数 8 / cfg 1**：turbo 权重官方配方，不要按常规 20 步调\n- **shift 3**（`ModelSamplingAuraFlow`）：ACE-Step 官方模板值，改大更发散、改小更贴提示词\n- **bpm / 调式**：`120` / `C minor` 为氛围乐默认，可按需改\n- **去 LLM 改写**：本工作流直连 md 表提示词，不做二次改写\n\n### 与 0062 的区别\n- 0060 走 ACE-Step（音乐结构、和声、节奏都在行）\n- 0062 走 Stable Audio 3 small_sfx（只擅长音效，不擅长成曲）"},"color":"#222","bgcolor":"#000"},{"id":1,"type":"FallingTSMarkDownTable","pos":[740,166],"size":[480,570],"flags":{},"order":1,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"data","name":"data","type":"FALLINGTS_MD_TABLE","widget":{"name":"data"},"link":null}],"outputs":[{"name":"ID","type":"STRING","slot_index":0,"links":[4]},{"name":"音乐提示词","type":"STRING","slot_index":1,"links":[1]},{"name":"秒数","type":"INT","slot_index":2,"links":[2,3]},{"name":"整行数据","type":"STRING","links":[]}],"title":"MD 数据表 (背景音乐)","properties":{"Node name for S&R":"FallingTSMarkDownTable","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{"data":true},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":[{"md_path":"stories/七纹刻印/0060_背景音乐.md","fields":[{"name":"ID","type":"STRING"},{"name":"音乐提示词","type":"TEXT"},{"name":"秒数","type":"INT"}],"selected":{"id":"00001_雨夜低缓钢琴","values":{"ID":"00001_雨夜低缓钢琴","音乐提示词":"深夜都市雨夜的极简氛围音乐，以低音钢琴单音为主，持续弦乐长音铺底，节奏极慢、力度极轻，克制而压抑，贴合凌晨三点三十三分失眠独处时的紧绷与空落。","秒数":"180"}}}],"widgets_values_named":{"data":{"md_path":"stories/七纹刻印/0060_背景音乐.md","fields":[{"name":"ID","type":"STRING"},{"name":"音乐提示词","type":"TEXT"},{"name":"秒数","type":"INT"}],"selected":{"id":"00001_雨夜低缓钢琴","values":{"ID":"00001_雨夜低缓钢琴","音乐提示词":"深夜都市雨夜的极简氛围音乐，以低音钢琴单音为主，持续弦乐长音铺底，节奏极慢、力度极轻，克制而压抑，贴合凌晨三点三十三分失眠独处时的紧绷与空落。","秒数":"180"}}}}},{"id":5,"type":"EmptyAceStep1.5LatentAudio","pos":[1300,166],"size":[250,172],"flags":{},"order":2,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"localized_name":"seconds","name":"seconds","type":"FLOAT","widget":{"name":"seconds"},"link":3}],"outputs":[{"localized_name":"LATENT","name":"LATENT","type":"LATENT","links":[12]}],"properties":{"Node name for S&R":"EmptyAceStep1.5LatentAudio","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{"seconds":true,"batch_size":true},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":[120,1],"widgets_values_named":{"seconds":120,"batch_size":1}},{"id":2,"type":"CheckpointLoaderSimple","pos":[1300,398],"size":[250,166],"flags":{},"o